  "referenceNumber": "RUS2710",
  "remarks": "\nIMO 9292577 (“RICCA”) is involved in activity whose object or effect is to destabilise Ukraine or undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine or to obtain a benefit from or support the Government of Russia. Namely, IMO 9292577 is involved in carrying oil or oil products that originated in Russia from Russia to a third country.\n",
